OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is London's mobile phone
OL,4,Areception getting worse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FMobile users across London say their
OL,7,Fmobile service is becoming increasingly
OL,8,Funreliable, with reports of slow data
OL,9,Fspeeds, failed connections and calls
OL,10,Fnot getting through.
OL,12,FMobile UK, the trade association
OL,13,Frepresenting the UK's major mobile
OL,14,Fnetworks, said London's mobile phone
OL,15,Fconnectivity "continues to lag
OL,16,Ffrustratingly behind other
OL,17,Finternational hubs".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
