OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is London's mobile phone
OL,4,Areception getting worse?
OL,5,
OL,6,FData commissioned by the BBC England
OL,7,FData Unit found some of the worst areas
OL,8,Fwere Liverpool Street and Covent
OL,9,FGarden, where service proved to be
OL,10,Fextremely slow and unreliable during
OL,11,Frush hour but worked normally during
OL,12,Fquieter periods.
OL,14,FSo what impact does this lack of
OL,15,Fconnectivity have on Londoners and
OL,16,Ftheir ability to earn a living, and
OL,17,Fwhat are the reasons behind it?
